 ### 3D-aware Image Synthesis via Sparse Voxel Grids
-A 3D-aware image synthesis generator that predicts color and density values on a sparse voxel grid, conditioned on camera pose [S2]. It uses a mapping network with 2 layers and 64 channels [S2]. The channel base is set to 4000 (reduced from StyleGAN2's 32768) to account for higher parameter count in 3D convolutions [S2]. It implements skip connections that add an upsampled version of the output grid of the previous layer to the input of the next layer [S2]. It conditions the generator on a camera pose represented by a rotation matrix and a translation vector, yielding a 12-dimensional input vector [S2]. It outputs coefficients of spherical harmonics for color; using degree 0 (single coefficient per color channel) [S2]. It multiplies the network's density output by a factor of 30 to facilitate generating high density values for sharp surfaces [S2].
